              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">A standard bearer has a hand weapon, light armour and shield. Army Standard Bearer. May ride in a chariot or on an elephant bought at additional cost from the list, or on a 6” movement horse (+7), and may in each case have heavy armour (+1).</characteristic>
