              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">The two crewmen are armed with hand weapon, composite bow, javelins and light armour and sit astride the elephant. The mahout is unarmed. A third crewman may be added (+22). One crewman may carry a parasol (+10) which adds +1 to the mahout’s leadership.</characteristic>
