              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">All chariots have a driver and two crewmen armed with hand weapon, javelins and halberd. Light Chariots or Heavy Chariots. Used to Elephants. May have light armour (+4), and composite bow (+8) or shield (+2) but not both.</characteristic>
