              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Escorts have hand weapon, halberd, javelins and shield. They may replace halberd with two-handed sword or club (+1). They are Skirmishers and Escorts and one unit is allowed for every chariot unit or elephant in the army. No unit may be more than 12 figures strong.</characteristic>
