              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Forest tribesmen have improvised weapons and javelins. They may have bucklers (free) and may substitute slings (free), short bows (free) or composite bows (+1) for javelins. Skirmishers. One unit allowed for every elephant or chariot escort unit in the army.</characteristic>
